{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:26:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_fffa913838404f5bbd3cc6cedea07a52","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1472a2d327a4a10c7db33eb840a1d53c4a3766deeb6f0b800f00298177e91c4c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"2389-research/coven@36edb5c206af snapshot 6601678b4e805296","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_266edc5384f8847122a34594491c00e924ea726d15328fcbb003a1969f4173a4","slc_56287bed3501b518abfe4a98c08dabfd4458736de82c3d7480bd927217468188"],"source_ids":["src_b1123ce7cf885c28b57a4a28eb90d930","src_de0cdd2be5075a92859ff71c24a054d7"],"text":"coven-swarm provides a supervisor command for multi-workspace orchestration, documented as spawning agents per workspace.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:26:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fffa913838404f5bbd3cc6cedea07a52"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:26:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_fffa913838404f5bbd3cc6cedea07a52","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_34e17f71863776f344fe195c92924d20db7c4074ff7de6cda326a394b4260df0","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"2389-research/coven@36edb5c206af snapshot 6601678b4e805296","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4ae6bb829719ab50ddac006ea52631f97863641af1f5b7071700cade744069d1","slc_c4a5de8cd6dd250dac8429843e6054b8e827c7cb3a2be7d641de1293693196cb"],"source_ids":["src_de0cdd2be5075a92859ff71c24a054d7"],"text":"The gateway stores threads (frontend-to-agent session mappings), messages (conversation history), and bindings (channel-to-agent routing) in SQLite; agents keep a local threads.db cache and session state.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:26:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fffa913838404f5bbd3cc6cedea07a52"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:26:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_fffa913838404f5bbd3cc6cedea07a52","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_378556347b3f70811a59a010e8818e530e29ea2f988331455d56142c08b1ec51","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"2389-research/coven@36edb5c206af snapshot 6601678b4e805296","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1b9a89e6bd79ff8b05c8d30929b55abd706b75504f175b36aed7255dec1d1b72","slc_7d79c091b8bb6e18e4eee69949454cfe3637be29a21d644bd154c5bdf9e7a1c4","slc_d253cd14b21d08be7d29daea4c7b61fa649dc242d33fc0dbf9660c0ff94816fe"],"source_ids":["src_de0cdd2be5075a92859ff71c24a054d7"],"text":"Agents register with the gateway over gRPC, receive a Welcome containing session_id and configuration, then send heartbeats every 30 seconds while the gateway tracks last_seen.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:26:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fffa913838404f5bbd3cc6cedea07a52"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:26:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_fffa913838404f5bbd3cc6cedea07a52","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4db38509841e9716be85ec09dbe73641ccdc9e6540acd588791ad9afdce9197b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"2389-research/coven@36edb5c206af snapshot 6601678b4e805296","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_83d8edd14f89c3b52905bfc600a09b36b87c4baa9b9a579aa2d190c38d533d55"],"source_ids":["src_b1123ce7cf885c28b57a4a28eb90d930"],"text":"The project comprises a Rust monorepo (agents, CLI, TUI, packs), a Go gateway server for routing, storage and pack registry, and shared Protobuf definitions (coven-proto).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:26:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fffa913838404f5bbd3cc6cedea07a52"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:26:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_fffa913838404f5bbd3cc6cedea07a52","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5799f746f16d09a9cbae122272d28b5927634007dcb7bc2a887237151e401e9c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"2389-research/coven@36edb5c206af snapshot 6601678b4e805296","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5bf580a39e07496b4f1c8bfe5aa7facf43f05e8a989833d138cd5ae145adb1c3","slc_d077eec8dda90d7931e6164405889c70b4ff8910e979b024786dfe978f0854f2"],"source_ids":["src_b1123ce7cf885c28b57a4a28eb90d930"],"text":"Coven is described as a Rust-based platform for orchestrating AI agents with tool capabilities, connecting Claude-powered agents to a central gateway.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:26:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fffa913838404f5bbd3cc6cedea07a52"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:26:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_fffa913838404f5bbd3cc6cedea07a52","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_72e8b026f5814980f94e0f0da52ee12409a7a6d5b4b572dc6015125b7eaa8bf3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"2389-research/coven@36edb5c206af snapshot 6601678b4e805296","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_73c2addefb5c1bd80ed3b39e9e8eb5d09819015d486ffff48de42e8731706995","slc_a50451cd0f27acb832395ba98075aefca2cd6697950a07497645391f5ba68024"],"source_ids":["src_de0cdd2be5075a92859ff71c24a054d7","src_f2c141fb5ce75fecbd0a181255e026cb"],"text":"Crate dependencies are layered: coven-proto, coven-ssh, and coven-swarm-core have no internal deps; coven-agent depends on coven-core, coven-pack, coven-grpc, and coven-proto.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:26:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fffa913838404f5bbd3cc6cedea07a52"}
